-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
-- SESSIONS  (31 days × 4 sessions = 124 sessions)
--
-- Layout per day (cycling through computers 1-20 and clients 1-40):
--   Session A  08:00–10:00  Common computer  Day-Common tariff
--   Session B  10:30–13:00  Common computer  Day-Common tariff
--   Session C  14:00–17:00  VIP    computer  Day-VIP    tariff
--   Session D  22:00–01:00  VIP    computer  Night-VIP  tariff
--
-- computer_id and client_id rotate by day so every FK is valid.
-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

